DualDelay: a delay-time jump crossfades instead of gliding (a3-core rulings R17, R18).

Applied by cmake/A3IemNodes.cmake at configure time to a copy of DualDelay/Source in the
build tree (patch -p1 from that Source directory); third_party/IEMPluginSuite stays clean at
its pin. A target time that moves by more than a3::delay::crossfadeAboveRatio jumps: the
line reads the old and the new position together and crossfades equal-power over
a3::delay::crossfadeSeconds (both in src/a3-delay/DelayParameters.h), then continues at the
new time. A smaller move keeps IEM's 0.5 Hz glide. Configure fails if this no longer applies.

